			},
			"date": "2025-06-20T17:54:36.213Z",
			"content": "<p>We have E-Mail-addresses anyone can drop any BS into. We have phones anyone random person can call without previous permission or authentication. Sometimes we should be as flabbergasted about what we still have, not just the stuff we used to have.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
