				"name": "George Rodier",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/georgerodier.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:dk66belhjtfadbud2kpbq6sc/bafkreicsmacnv6omeh3ojag4u2daotenc272hhbdcuczchtr765td5ocya"
			},
			"date": "2025-06-20T21:46:23.745Z",
			"content": "<p>Part of the reason I got into programming was because I was working for my Dad in my late teens by getting invoices via fax and then manually inputting them into custom software and then sending a fax back for confirmation.</p>\n<p>And all I could think was that there had to be a better way!</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3ls2zi4j4dc2a",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:ebrgxjbu6rhgvigjlxlo3c4y/app.bsky.feed.post/3ls2xtzckkk2o",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3ls2zi4j4dc2a",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2025-06-20T21:51:09.770Z",
			"content": "<p>I’m curious if it’s just another example of shipping things without considering consequences at scale 😅</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:ebrgxjbu6rhgvigjlxlo3c4y/app.bsky.feed.post/3ls37jun33k2s",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3ls2zi4j4dc2a",
