				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ebrgxjbu6rhgvigjlxlo3c4y/bafkreidnvjbwvhybw2gfjetkkpkrf2vhefo37hqvipkxzny2echodcfhm4"
			},
			"date": "2025-06-20T23:39:31.071Z",
			"content": "<p>Most certainly.</p>\n<p>One of the blind spots was not anticipating how things change when they’re inexpensive operations.</p>\n<p>Remember when we paid like $0.05 per text? No bad actor would consider spamming people the way they do now with fake job offers and phishing attempts.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
